OL,3,GNEWSAHunt family completes walk for
OL,4,Amurdered loved ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FRacing commentator John Hunt has
OL,7,Fcompleted a 120-mile (190km) charity
OL,8,Fwalk in memory of his wife Carol and
OL,9,Fdaughters Louise and Hannah, who were
OL,10,Fmurdered in 2024.
OL,12,FHunt, along with his daughter Amy,
OL,13,Fsister Alison and Amy's fiance Gareth,
OL,14,Fleft their home in Hertfordshire on 19
OL,15,FSeptember to walk to Bournemouth in
OL,16,FDorset - a place long "cherished" by
OL,17,Fthe family.
OL,19,FKyle Clifford, Louise's former partner,
OL,20,Fmurdered the women at the family home
OL,21,Fin Bushey, Hertfordshire, in July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
